{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t選舉委員會界別分組選舉結果陸續公布，酒店界16名當選人分別是邱詠筠、周偉淦、鄭家安、盧曉楓、HARILELA Aron Hari、呂慧瑜、邱文華、羅俊謙、郭惠光、吳錦鴻、凌緣庭、陳淑儀、鄭志雯、霍美華、麥汝輝、羅寳文。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：羅詠暉\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T14:43:50.742176+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":116,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T13:41:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T15:37:31.166108+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T14:37:28.453285+00:00","content_hash":"40db2d8972622498ff08c2395490f26a5eb7cb7ccb604e15dd638d5fa5048144","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}